{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014xiaVTYhTFajcaCevqh9ms","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VxpYYJfQx9bnLhBwagFxzs","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"schema-dag-extraction","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6496,"cache_read_input_tokens":17009,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6496,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":43,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UzTToiYWcs1nZ316G6h21P","session_id":"fedf8bd9-cdbd-4afd-b68e-e46304bb8fb5","uuid":"bad0f324-0bcb-40c0-b814-99f7241251e1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VxpYYJfQx9bnLhBwagFxzs","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — schema-dag-extraction\\\\n\\\\n## D008 证据层级 (2026-05-15, FINAL)\\\\n**三层证据（全部基于 text_match reeval 干净数据）：**\\\\n1. **Layer 1 (Primary) — Pairwise BCS-confusion**: Pearson r=0.156 (p=4.6e-12, n=1953 pairs); 非零 Spearman ρ=0.254 (p=1.1e-6)。Immune to frequency confound。\\\\n2. **Layer 2 (Supporting) — Per-type F1 vs BCS** (n=63 types, freq≥5): Spearman ρ=-0.293 (p=0.020); Partial r=-0.200 (p=0.116) 控制 log-freq; Quartile Δ=-8.2pp (high BCS F1=0.228 vs low BCS F1=0.310)。**关键**: BCS-freq 在 type 级别不相关 (r=0.042, p=0.74)，确认 batch-level 正相关是 frequency 聚合 artifact。\\\\n3. **Layer 3 (Discussion) — Batch-level**: F1-BCS 正相关（反直觉）。原因: high-freq types 同时 high-BCS + high-F1。Transparently reported 作为方法论贡献。\\\\n\\\\n**叙事**: \\\\\\\"naive→controlled→mechanistic\\\\\\\" 方法论进阶。Batch-level 正相关 motivate 我们转向 per-type 和 pairwise 分析。\\\\n\\\\n**Recall vs BCS 不显著** (partial r=0.252, p=0.066)——confusability 机制是\\\\\\\"找到但标错类型\\\\\\\"（type confusion），不是\\\\\\\"漏掉实体\\\\\\\"（recall）。\\\\n\\\\n## D005 Narrative: Multi-channel Degradation (方案 A)\\\\n- Count → recall decline（exp1: 0.72→0.42 单调下降）\\\\n- Confusability → type confusion（exp2: pairwise + per-type evidence）\\\\n- 两者正交\\\\n\\\\n## D007: FewRel RE Pilot 策略 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- 先做低成本 pilot，不直接 commit\\\\n- RE confusability 机制可能不同（取决于 entity pair 语义角色，不仅是 label embedding）\\\\n- **FewRel 实际 80 relations（非 100）**：train 64 + val 16\\\\n\\\\n## Multi-model 决策 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- **LLaMA-3.3-70B-Instruct-FP8** (nvidia/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct-FP8)\\\\n\\\\n## SDGD 设计决策 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- **阈值**: adaptive (mean + k·std)，k 唯一超参。Fixed τ 仅 oracle baseline。\\\\n- **消融**: k sweep {0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0}\\\\n- **Multi-pass FP**: exp-008 必须 prompt v2 + 报告 merged pred_gold_ratio\\\\n\\\\n## 数据集 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- **Few-NERD**: NER, 66 types, test 37648\\\\n- **MAVEN**: ED, 168 types, valid 8042 sentences / 18904 mentions。已下载+预处理。Qwen3 BCS: mean=0.7016, std=0.1486（比 Few-NERD 0.7837/0.0653 分布更宽）\\\\n- **FewRel**: RE, 80 relations, train 44800 + val 11200。已下载+预处理\\\\n\\\\n## 文献 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- 25 篇收录，novelty 安全\\\\n- CROSSAGENTIE: proactive (ours) vs reactive (theirs)\\\\n- 必须对比: LLM-PEE, PARSE\\\\n\\\\n## 论文准备 (2026-05-15)\\\\n- Method §3.2 已修正：count values + F1 vs recall 指标选择说明\\\\n- Related work 初稿完成（3 维度，25 篇）\\\\n- MAVEN 描述段落完成\\\\n\\\\n## Evaluation 根因 (2026-05-14)\\\\nQwen3-32B-FP8 96.5% char offset 编造。Over-prediction count=1 pred/gold=6.8:1。\\\\n\\\\n## Environment (2026-05-14)\\\\n- cqa1-38874: RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB, CUDA 13.1\\\\n- conda base: Python 3.12.3, vLLM 0.20.2, torch 2.10.0+cu128\\\\n- Qwen3-32B-FP8 at /root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/qwen3-32b-fp8/\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2381, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UzTToiYWcs1nZ316G6h21P","session_id":"fedf8bd9-cdbd-4afd-b68e-e46304bb8fb5","uuid":"0bf9c653-7af6-4a19-b0d5-0b6ec574056c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T06:12:51.114Z"}
